The source study is:

Lee DH, Lee BK, Cho YS, Jung YH, Lee HY, Jeung KW, Youn CS, Kim SH, on
behalf of Korean Hypothermia Network Investigators (2022). Association
between insulin administration method and six-month neurological outcome in
survivors of out-of-hospital cardiac arrest who underwent targeted
